13	 * Lane two is the migrated tree: the adapter's composed changeset for the
14	 * Angular 16.2 cell, computed over the same pinned tree. Nothing in this driver
15	 * decides what to change. Every such decision lives in `@versionless/angular`,
16	 * which knows nothing about this application.
17	 *
18	 * This driver is fixture-scoped: it knows where this fixture's lanes were
19	 * materialised, and nothing else.
20	 */
